# rocq-of-solidity outputs are produced by
# `bash scripts/ir-rocq-coverage` and dropped here. They are
# regenerable from current contract sources; we commit the
# directory and its docs but not the outputs themselves.
#
# Equivalence proofs under proofs/equivalence/ reference these
# files by stable path (rocq/generated/<ContractName>.v); the
# regen step is a prereq before building that tier.

# Generated Yul IR
*.v

# OpenZeppelin sweep outputs (--include-oz) — gitignored as a whole
# subtree since the .v rule above already covers their files, but
# we list it explicitly so the directory's intent is obvious.
oz/

# Compiled Coq artifacts that show up here if files are built
*.vo
*.vos
*.vok
*.glob
*.aux
.*.aux

# Per-file diagnostic logs the sweep script may drop here
*.log
*.out

# Keep these
!.gitignore
!README.md
